---
title: Checkout ownership
---
flowchart TD
  worktree([A worktree Git registers]) --> harness{Under a directory a harness<br/>keeps worktrees in?}
  harness -->|yes| theirs[A harness's own isolation<br/>shown, left to its harness]
  harness -->|no| recorded{Carries UZE's record,<br/>directly under .worktrees?}
  recorded -->|no| operator[The operator's<br/>shown; only the operator adopts or removes it]
  recorded -->|a newer build's| unreadable[UZE's, unreadable<br/>never reused or removed]
  recorded -->|yes| slot{A subagent's?}
  slot -->|yes| child[Held for its agent<br/>until joined or its agent ends]
  slot -->|no| inuse{A process working inside?}
  inuse -->|yes, its agent's| occupied[Occupied]
  inuse -->|yes, nobody's agent| pinned
  inuse -->|no| paused{A rebase, merge, pick<br/>or bisect paused in it?}
  paused -->|yes| pinned[Pinned, with its reason<br/>nothing reset, nothing reused]
  paused -->|no| work{Its agent gone,<br/>leaving work in it?}
  work -->|a submodule or nested repository,<br/>or the shelf could not be written| pinned
  work -->|yes| shelve[Released: uncommitted work to<br/>refs/uze/shelf/task, commits on its branch,<br/>the checkout detached and cleaned]
  work -->|only a lock that moved no pin,<br/>or managed regions| free
  work -->|no| free[Free]
  shelve --> free
  free --> idle{Used within the idle age?}
  idle -->|yes| kept[Kept for the next agent]
  idle -->|no| removed[Directory removed, branch kept]
